OL,3,AVolcano eruption triggers flight
OL,4,Asuspensions at Indonesia's main airport
OL,5,
OL,6,FA volcanic eruption has halted hundreds
OL,7,Fof flights at Indonesia's main
OL,8,Finternational airport, stranding tens
OL,9,Fof thousands of passengers.
OL,11,FAuthorities said 209 flights were
OL,12,Fsuspended after ash from Mount Anak
OL,13,FKrakatoa was detected in airspace near
OL,14,FJakarta's Soekarno-Hatta International
OL,15,FAirport on Sunday morning.
OL,17,FThe volcano had started erupting late
OL,18,Fon Friday night, generating continuous
OL,19,Fseismic activity, lava fountains, and
OL,20,Fbooming sounds across surrounding
OL,21,Fregions. Two more eruptions happened
OL,22,Fearly on Sunday, authorities said.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,0,100
