OL,3,AVolcano eruption triggers flight
OL,4,Asuspensions at Indonesia's main airport
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 22,000 people have been
OL,7,Fimpacted by the suspension of flights,
OL,8,Fwhich has been extended until 13:30
OL,9,F(0630 GMT).
